{"title":"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">2000 AMC 12 #15</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">2000 AMC 10 #24</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Similar)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Similar)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> be a function for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b3e4c8652c6208d3f50a3807c02987eb27d1011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\dfrac{x}{3}\\right) = x^2 + x + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"35\" />. Find the sum of all values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/95661bb2c082649ba9dc0a183e6160f9d5051b19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3z) = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/9/9d90ea2ca3f651f82e9c5b1b0c139682607ea340.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text {(A)}\\ -1/3 \\qquad \\text {(B)}\\ -1/9 \\qquad \\text {(C)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\text {(D)}\\ 5/9 \\qquad \\text {(E)}\\ 5/3\\]\" width=\"445\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e98101b79673e02427a2bb07eac06d3116b5003b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"46\" height=\"33\" />; then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/e/06e828b5fa24b66c1621078de66e2ba22998c702.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y) = (3y)^2 + 3y + 1 = 9y^2 + 3y+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"292\" height=\"19\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08da641a10bbfdf9baf2a025ccc76455e878cc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3z)-7=81z^2+9z-6=3(9z-2)(3z+1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"399\" height=\"19\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/8/268af59ad48e5fd444324e3002756920f23a6f11.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = -\\frac{1}{3}, \\frac{2}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />. These sum up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/6/086bcbd58c1cea5328947579833b19255fc5a55d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"81\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Similar.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Similar)\">Solution 2 (Similar)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Similar)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This is quite trivially solved, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e5712c01726c0331a35379effb5f4547e3074de3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x = \\dfrac{9x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a023dc84f37804d3e0edfa3649bc7c886a24bdf5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(3x) = P(9x/3) = 81x^2 + 9x + 1 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"307\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d1511be2b6a88c0ba4a31c024c147dbfcd65329.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81x^2+9x-6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> has solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44eecfc043d7b666561dbe643e5fc3b9fc80db6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/1/041a0b37ca609642fb34c7c855b9d67ed498a560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />. Adding these yields a solution of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/6/086bcbd58c1cea5328947579833b19255fc5a55d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"81\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~ icecreamrolls8\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Similar to Solution 1, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/9/f8937deeeda04ed1a73ca62da50903f84179e547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=81z^2+9z-6=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"162\" height=\"16\" /> The answer is the sum of the roots, which by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_Formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s Formulas\">Vieta's Formulas</a> is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c82688add8087207f840c2ce68e1cae623d534.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{b}{a}=-\\frac{9}{81}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"194\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~dolphin7\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/7/fb7965750172b462df76226223fba75133fbecfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f\\left(\\frac{x}{3} \\right) = x^2+x+1=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"35\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f045dd47c0a82c9f9b636c7482ea787e25200095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+x-6=0.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"16\" /> From either finding the roots (-3 and 2), or using Vieta's formulas, we find the sum of these roots to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/09352e06cfa1651aa82e838b91724b60b068d41d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"30\" height=\"15\" /> Each root of this equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times greater than a corresponding root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/6/95661bb2c082649ba9dc0a183e6160f9d5051b19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3z) = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> (because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/06167224475a05dd52e79b9f8a3cf391d0603da2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{3} = 3z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"56\" height=\"33\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/1/b8195dc58b1c36956421ab21cee01cb80ecd5228.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 9z$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />), thus the sum of the roots in the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29aab5b21e0e8c706734e036f5b9ceed0159e573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3z)=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/5/2a5ea0270dfa0406fb26ccadaef70497904df790.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/6/086bcbd58c1cea5328947579833b19255fc5a55d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"81\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/4865783174ccec96ba337446301fe177ef3dfaa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x/3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe7b2c7577d434817f97097ea66efd30b567ccae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(3z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"18\" /> occurs at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/3/4a30b38a05b7c1df66ac9398c0244f0a01624b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=9z.$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/436b2551a59549859ddf3fd65066378ecd24ffc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(9z/3) = f(3z) = (9z)^2 + 9z + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"19\" />. We set this equal to 7:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/3/cf36ba3a5ff3fe698b3a0a88fc703f453c83e6a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$81z^2 + 9z +1 = 7 \\Longrightarrow 81z^2 + 9z - 6 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"319\" height=\"16\" />. For any quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a6feb86fd2adcd3c1c1d2babb9ddd697174f4db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + bx +c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" />, the sum of the roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b848e82a6f7ef8135636b57ab2da5825a55b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{b}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"26\" height=\"37\" />. Thus, the sum of the roots of this equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcd76da710f6cd3b84985d8b52fd3c6069fc53e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{9}{81} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-\\frac19}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"142\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Power_Solve\">Video Solution by Power Solve</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Power Solve\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/G4c2oCtupTg?si=onJiETThdTQOlrde&amp;t=946\">https://youtu.be/G4c2oCtupTg?si=onJiETThdTQOlrde&amp;t=946</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qR85EBnpWV8\">https://youtu.be/qR85EBnpWV8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=NyoLydoc3j8&amp;feature=youtu.be\">https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=NyoLydoc3j8&amp;feature=youtu.be</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZbcJ0ja5TJ8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZbcJ0ja5TJ8</a>   ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=1300\">https://youtu.be/3dfbWzOfJAI?t=1300</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12\" title=\"2000 AMC 12\">2000 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2000 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 14\">P